Description: Fast, GPU-accelerated, full-featured IDE and terminal multiplexer
 Rune is a fast, GPU-accelerated, full-featured IDE and terminal
 multiplexer, suitable both for automatic and manual programming.
 .
 X11 and OpenGL support is required only when opening a GUI window;
 TUI and headless modes run without a graphical stack.
